      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T11:48:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not a fan of not including FOREGROUND_SERVICE, as it makes it difficult for apps to do something even when they have a persistent notification about the ongoing work. But I checked that gmscore does end up in the list with FOREGROUND_SERVICE, so changed to FOREGROUND.\n\nNote current usage in gmscore probably uses the lock anyway though.",
